WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.050
Classifying helps us identify living things and talk about them clearly.

2
00:00:05.928 --> 00:00:10.603
An animal you don't know. Groups based on its features help you name it.

3
00:00:12.263 --> 00:00:14.963
It has a backbone, and no feathers.

4
00:00:19.142 --> 00:00:24.167
Identified. Now everyone can use one name, and know what it is related to.
